  "description": "The meme humorously references the common social phenomenon where people deflect responsibility for vehicle malfunctions by blaming mechanical issues rather than their own actions or maintenance. This is a relatable cultural trope, often used in self-deprecating humor, and requires real-world knowledge of car ownership and repair culture to fully appreciate.",
